Preservation evidence is the implementer's earlier direct-byte comparison: all 579 runtime-04 files (69,994,319 bytes), all 83 provider-runtime-06 files (68,980,002 bytes), and all 56 evaluator paths. The evaluator map is pinned to `005064e57e80840f3b2a97d7db694b176832b8f982996e63efc8a35064505ed4`. The reviewer read these reports rather than rerunning the checks; the updated task report accurately identifies preservation as the earlier check. Source/diff hashes listed above were independently computed.

No tests were read, created or run; no source imports, synthetic cases, probes, actual artifact readers/summaries, credentials/environment reads, provider/API, Docker, evaluator or campaign activity occurred. Reviewer edits are evidence documents only. Static inspection does not prove runtime behavior, atomic cross-file snapshots, cross-round publication timing or actual positive-policy execution. Those limits remain material and do not expand P2 scope.

## Quality assessment

**Approved for P2.** The five corrections address the identified pre-spend and failure-precedence gaps without broadening production scope or changing old serialized contracts. No additional finding arose from the focused fix review. Later increments and final integrated review remain required.
